[@295]
Your ally has been slain. Your rescue has failed. Back at camp you try to explain to the lord of <?{vn_windall}>Wind</?><?!{vn_windall}>Rain</?>~., but he suddenly reaches for his sword and screams at you "~I~BFailure will not be tolerated" "You must suffer for your incompetence"~. With this he thrusts his sword towards you, but you are too quick for him and jump back. Crazed with fear you look for a way out, but the last thing you ever see are his guards closing in on you.
<$Config,vn_death=1>
<$Config,vn_alive=0>
